[gd_resource type="ShaderMaterial" load_steps=2 format=3]

; The first instant of a ship coming apart: cream, the palette's brightest
; entry, on the star mesh so the flash throws rays rather than reading as a
; ball. Soft rimmed, so the rays fade out at their tips instead of ending in a
; straight cut.
;
; Colour from data/palette.json (cream). The explosion duplicates this before
; driving its alpha, because two ships dying at once must not share one fade.

[ext_resource type="Shader" path="res://assets/shaders/fx_billboard.gdshader" id="1"]

